---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-wrapper">
	<Header />

	<main class="main-content">
		<h1>About Me</h1>

		<p>
			Hi, I'm Hugo. I'm a developer who enjoys building software tools, experimenting with electronics, and self-hosting services.
		</p>

		<h2>What I Build</h2>
		<p>
			I spend most of my time working on side projects and exploring new tools:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Writing tools and utilities, currently spending time learning Go while building <strong>Spur</strong> (a static site generator) and light terminal applications like <strong>Mote</strong>.</li>
			<li><strong>Electronics & Hardware:</strong> Designing simple microcontroller boards and tinkering with hardware projects like <strong>Octoboard</strong>.</li>
			<li><strong>Homelab & Self-Hosting:</strong> Running my own server setup for personal tools, backups, and local services.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Homelab Setup</h2>
		<p>
			My homelab is where I host services I use daily and experiment with networking and infrastructure.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Services:</strong> Media, backups, local automation, and container management</li>
			<li><strong>OS & Environment:</strong> [e.g., Linux / Docker / Proxmox]</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
		<p>
			Feel free to check out my code or contact me:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/hhhug000" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/hhhug000</a></li>
		</ul>
	</main>
</div>
</body>
</html>